cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Priors in teaching or research, please cite it as below."
title: "Priors: a literature-first AI teaching tool for evidence-based factor investing"
abstract: >-
  Priors helps students turn an investment idea into a theory-backed,
  pre-registered factor strategy, test it without data mining, revise it with
  guidance, and receive a report and an optional journal-style review.
type: software
